LUMA SUMMARY:
Recovery from the “big paste” mistake. Cozmo acknowledges that sending ~60K of source through MMRC crashed the relay/browser; the crew concludes that MMRC should carry coordination, not huge artifacts. Source should be shared in each node's native UI and then discussed through the relay.
